# Docs vault

- Every substantive note needs YAML frontmatter (see `docs/00-meta/style-guide.md`).
- Filenames: `kebab-case.md`; ADRs: `ADR-NNNN-short-title.md`.
- Link with `[[wikilinks]]`; update MOC when adding concepts.
- No inline `data:image` base64 — use `docs/_attachments/`.
- Accepted ADRs are immutable; supersede with new ADR IDs.
- `audience: [agent]` notes should be factual and scannable; tutorials go in `07-guides/`.
